{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you access up to Chapter II, with most mechanics polished to give you a solid sense of the game and a great gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Doctor Dreams</i> puts you in the shoes of a doctor haunted by the mysterious disappearance of his father, who left behind a lonely clinic you must now manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While keeping the family legacy alive, you\u2019ll enter your patients\u2019 dreams to help them\u2014facing bosses, puzzles, fear, and adrenaline in visually unique worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s going on?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not everything is as it seems: a rival clinic hides a secret on the third floor. You\u2019ll need stealth and strategy to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face an advanced AI that learns from your movements and challenges you at every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Protect the family legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your clinic, hire staff, craft medicine, and make decisions that will impact life as we know it.  <br>Can you stop the antagonist\u2019s plan and save the city of New Thornfield?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0Unique Dreams</strong>  <br>Explore\u00a0 unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences, psychological horror, and narrative exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All presented in a striking and carefully crafted visual style that enhances the atmosphere of every world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medicine crafting system</strong> <br>Craft custom medicines to treat each patient based on what they experienced in their dream. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong> <br>Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and gain reputation\u2026 or go bankrupt due to malpractice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not satisfied curing by day?</strong> <br> <br>Decide to sell your potions illegally at night on the black market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>But beware: the police are watching. If caught, you could lose everything\u2026 and regret it later.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900630?t=1753881836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900630?t=1753881836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/ee073faffbc0156e9ea5aea8ecda7640f16657ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753881836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/ee073faffbc0156e9ea5aea8ecda7640f16657ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753881836","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you access up to Chapter II, with most mechanics polished to give you a solid sense of the game and a great gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/321fa0a9bdb41fe3a18b2f5f19588ff7.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are you?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Doctor Dreams</i> puts you in the shoes of a doctor haunted by the mysterious disappearance of his father, who left behind a lonely clinic you must now manage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While keeping the family legacy alive, you\u2019ll enter your patients\u2019 dreams to help them\u2014facing bosses, puzzles, fear, and adrenaline in visually unique worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s going on?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But not everything is as it seems: a rival clinic hides a secret on the third floor. You\u2019ll need stealth and strategy to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face an advanced AI that learns from your movements and challenges you at every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Protect the family legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your clinic, hire staff, craft medicine, and make decisions that will impact life as we know it.  <br>Can you stop the antagonist\u2019s plan and save the city of New Thornfield?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/1388c40dbc94ea9070714e9de50fb661.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0Unique Dreams</strong>  <br>Explore\u00a0 unique dreams divided into 5 chapters, each with completely different mechanics: from boss fights and puzzle solving to stealth sequences, psychological horror, and narrative exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All presented in a striking and carefully crafted visual style that enhances the atmosphere of every world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/790c84ec1817b92cd0853e7c38328c6a.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medicine crafting system</strong> <br>Craft custom medicines to treat each patient based on what they experienced in their dream. Combine unique ingredients, follow secret recipes, and experiment to discover new effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.poster.avif?t=1753881836\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.webm?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/8d4fbce132a87c3758d4e5dc84cd388f.mp4?t=1753881836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong> <br>Receive patients, clean rooms, hire staff, upgrade facilities, and gain reputation\u2026 or go bankrupt due to malpractice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900630/extras/9e9e89a339a3c42eb8506b6408ef4247.pos